        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: বিভাগ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "বিভাগ — bibhāg — \"a department; a division\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "আমার বোন এই কোম্পানির নতুন বিভাগে কাজ করে। Āmār bon ei kompānir nôtun bibhāge kāj kôre. My sister works in the company's new department."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "বিভাগ (bibhāg) is a tatsama, Sanskrit vibhāga, \"distribution, a share\" (Monier-Williams): a part of the whole."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for describing what you lived and felt."
            }
